  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The universe is not an expanse of orderly star systems, but is instead quite chaotic and full of strange anomalies and curiosities. Your clockwork facsimiles reflect this.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Know the clockwork universe greater manifestation</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you cast a genesis etherspell with the clockwork universe greater manifestation, you may select up to two different stars to be part of your clockwork model. The etherspell does not end until both stars are thrown or otherwise destroyed.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Clockwork universe supports a single star.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/greater-manifestations#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
